hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"2724","###\n Narrated to us by Bundar, who said: Narrated to us by Abd al-Wahhab, who said: Narrated to us by Khalid. And also narrated to us by Bishr ibn Hilal, who said: Narrated to us by Abd al-Warith, from Khalid, from Ikrimah, from Ibn Abbas (RA), who said: The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) circumambulated the Ka'bah while riding a camel, and whenever he came to the Corner (the Black Stone), he would gesture towards"
